      'Macau — 1-hour TurboJet ferry from Hong Kong. The Ruins of St. Paul\'s, Senado Square, and the Venetian Cotai has an actual gondola canal inside — kids find it surreal. Lord Stow\'s egg tarts are among the best in the world.',
